before putting real money to work. The S&amp;P 500 closed at 7,712, down 0.2%. The NASDAQ composite finished at 26,402, off 0.5%. The TSX composite slipped 0.8% to 36,554. Sentiment stayed cautious as investors digested mixed macro signals ahead of Friday's jobs data.

