00:01:45.840 --> 00:02:11.160
That rotation signal sets up our first deep dive segment today. B.O.F.A. Strategist Michael Hartnett argues markets are pricing in moderate midterm results plus continued deregulation and AI-friendly policies that may not fully materialize. This creates a classic over optimism setup where investors should apply evaluation screen first, then layer a same day volume check before adding exposure.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:29.980
The approach works best in late cycle environments when policy assumptions drive multiples higher than fundamental support. Implement it by pulling the unusual whales options flow feed for unusual put activity on high multiple tech names, then cross reference with the 20 day average volume on any candidate.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:38.600
