Confidence level is medium because the fundamental setup is strong yet volume confirmation is still pending and sector rotation pressure remains elevated.

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:14.760
This watch list item demonstrates how to combine valuation discipline with a pending catalyst while respecting current sector rotation signals.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:22.380
Listeners learn to wait for volume above the 20 day average before committing capital rather than chasing headline momentum.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:33.840
The setup also respects the rule requiring volume confirmation on any name already facing sector rotation pressure. That volume rule was reinforced by yesterday's result.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:45.980
Last weekly hold was ALK on a catalyst entry for the new high-grade domain discovery at Cuffly Load. The actual hold ran four calendar days of market data from Monday to Friday.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:05:02.040
Entry came at $1.86 on Monday open and exit at $1.85 on Friday close. The result was a loss of 0.54% or negative $5.38 on the $1,000 position.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:10.360
The discovery catalyst produced an initial pop that faded without sustained buyer interest once broader market sentiment turned defensive.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:18.340
Rule. Require volume above the 20 day average before entering any catalyst driven name already in a sector rotation.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:30.160
This same caution applies when sizing alternative assets. Imagine you added a 3% position in a Canadian Bitcoin ETF last month after reading about institutional flows.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:42.220
Your order filled at the market price but what actually happened behind the scenes was a brief liquidity gap that widened the bid ask spread from 4 cents to 18 cents in the first 15 minutes of trading.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:59.360
Canadian investors can access BTCX or ETHX on the TSX with the same TFSA contribution room as any equity. Yet the tax treatment differs because crypto gains are treated as capital gains with the new inclusion rate applying above the annual threshold.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:08.700
Professionals always check the ETF's premium or discount to net asset value before entry and compare it against the previous 5 day average.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:19.760
Bitcoin versus altcoin risk profiles differ sharply because Bitcoin benefits from institutional custody solutions while many altcoins face higher regulatory and liquidity risks.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:27.700
Self-custody wallets reduce exchange counterparty exposure but introduce key loss risk that exchange held positions avoid.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:37.860
The regulatory landscaping Canada continues to evolve through CSA guidance on stable coins and trading platforms which can affect listing eligibility for new products.

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:53.380
The biggest misconception is treating crypto like a high beta tech stock. The one sentence fix is to size any allocation between 1 and 5% of total portfolio value and rebalance only when it drifts more than 2 percentage points from target.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:07:07.780
